below 2,
.Va allow.mount ,
.Va allow.mount.devfs ,
.Va allow.mount.nullfs ,
.Va allow.mount.procfs ,
.Va allow.mount.fdescfs ,
.Va allow.mount.tmpfs
where USE_TMPFS is set,
.Va allow.mount.zfs
where ZPOOL is
.Pq and the dataset jailed to it, Ql zfs jail ,
and what poudriere gives each build jail, which the parent must have:
.Va allow.chflags ,
.Va allow.raw_sockets ,
.Va allow.socket_af
and
.Va allow.sysvipc .
